<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Zyler Delavictoria – IT Graduate Portfolio</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bricolage+Grotesque:opsz,wght@12..96,500;12..96,800&family=Instrument+Sans:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{--paper:#F2F5F3;--panel:#E1E8E6;--ink:#14232B;--mute:#587078;--cable:#E5560F;--line:#C3CFCC;
box-sizing:border-box;padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);padding-bottom:env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px);color-scheme:light}
html{scroll-padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);scroll-behavior:smooth}
@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root:not([data-theme="light"]){--paper:#0F1B21;--panel:#18282F;--ink:#E8EFEC;--mute:#8FA7AE;--cable:#FF7A3D;--line:#2B4048;color-scheme:dark}}
:root[data-theme="dark"]{--paper:#0F1B21;--panel:#18282F;--ink:#E8EFEC;--mute:#8FA7AE;--cable:#FF7A3D;--line:#2B4048;color-scheme:dark}
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font:400 17px/1.6 "Instrument Sans",system-ui,sans-serif}
a{color:inherit}
:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--cable);outline-offset:3px}
.wrap{max-width:960px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 22px}
nav{display:flex;gap:22px;justify-content:flex-end;padding:18px 0;font-weight:500;font-size:15px}
nav a{text-decoration:none;color:var(--mute)}nav a:hover{color:var(--ink)}
.hero{padding:40px 0 70px}
.hero{display:grid;gap:34px;grid-template-columns:1fr;align-items:end}
.hero .intro{min-width:0}
.photo{margin:0;justify-self:start;width:min(100%,320px);aspect-ratio:4/5;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--panel);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px var(--cable)}
.photo img{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:40% 30%}
.cable{grid-column:1/-1}
@media(min-width:820px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1.6fr 1fr;gap:48px}.photo{justify-self:end;width:100%;max-width:340px}}
@media(max-width:819px){.photo{order:-1;width:min(60%,240px)}}

h1{font:800 clamp(52px,13vw,128px)/.92 "Bricolage Grotesque",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.03em;margin:0}
.hero p.role{font:500 clamp(20px,3.2vw,28px)/1.3 "Bricolage Grotesque",sans-serif;margin:26px 0 0;max-width:30ch}
.cable{display:block;width:100%;height:80px;margin:34px 0 0}
.cable path{fill:none;stroke:var(--cable);stroke-width:5;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-dasharray:1400;stroke-dashoffset:1400;animation:draw 1.8s .2s ease-out forwards}
.cable rect{fill:var(--ink)}
@keyframes draw{to{stroke-dashoffset:0}}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.cable path{animation:none;stroke-dashoffset:0}html{scroll-behavior:auto}}
section{padding:56px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
h2{font:800 clamp(30px,5vw,44px)/1.05 "Bricolage Grotesque",sans-serif;margin:0 0 26px;letter-spacing:-.02em}
.about{display:grid;gap:26px;grid-template-columns:1fr}
.about p{margin:0;max-width:62ch}
.facts{display:grid;gap:10px;margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none;font-size:15px;color:var(--mute)}
.facts b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}
@media(min-width:760px){.about{grid-template-columns:1.6fr 1fr}}
.proj{display:grid;gap:14px;padding:28px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.proj:first-of-type{border-top:0;padding-top:0}
.proj h3{font:800 26px/1.15 "Bricolage Grotesque",sans-serif;margin:0}
.proj p{margin:0;max-width:62ch}
.tags{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none}
.tags li{background:var(--panel);padding:3px 12px;border-radius:99px;font-size:14px;font-weight:500}
.proj ul.do{margin:0;padding-left:20px;max-width:62ch}
@media(min-width:760px){.proj{grid-template-columns:200px 1fr;gap:30px}.proj .tags{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start}}
.skills{display:grid;gap:30px;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr))}
.skills h3{font:800 19px "Bricolage Grotesque",sans-serif;margin:0 0 10px;color:var(--cable)}
.skills ul{margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none;display:grid;gap:6px}
.contact p{max-width:52ch;margin:0 0 22px}
.btns{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px}
.btn{display:inline-block;padding:12px 22px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}
.btn.alt{background:transparent;color:var(--ink);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 2px var(--ink)}
footer{padding:30px 0 40px;color:var(--mute);font-size:14px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
<nav aria-label="Sections"><a href="#about">About</a><a href="#projects">Projects</a><a href="#skills">Skills</a><a href="#contact">Contact</a></nav>

<header class="hero">
<div class="intro">
<h1>Zyler<br>Delavictoria</h1>
<p class="role">Fresh IT graduate who builds web systems and plans the networks they run on.</p>
</div>
<figure class="photo"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Zyler Delavictoria taking a mirror selfie at the gym" width="560" height="700"></figure>
<svg class="cable" viewBox="0 0 900 80" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
<rect x="0" y="28" width="22" height="24" rx="4"/>
<path d="M22 40 H260 C320 40 330 14 390 14 H520 C580 14 590 66 650 66 H866"/>
<rect x="866" y="28" width="22" height="24" rx="4"/>
</svg>
</header>

<section id="about">
<h2>About</h2>
<div class="about">
<p>I’m a recent Information Technology graduate (called Zy by friends) with hands-on experience building database-driven web applications and designing school-wide network layouts. I like projects where real users have real rules to follow, such as who can see which records and which department connects to which network.</p>
<ul class="facts">
<li><b>Degree</b><br>BS Information Technology [add school and year]</li>
<li><b>Focus</b><br>Web development, network design</li>
<li><b>Location</b><br>[add city, country]</li>
<li><b>Looking for</b><br>Entry-level web developer or IT support roles</li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>

<section id="projects">
<h2>Projects</h2>

<article class="proj">
<ul class="tags" aria-label="Technologies"><li>PHP</li><li>MySQL</li><li>XAMPP</li><li>bcrypt</li></ul>
<div>
<h3>P-DAS: School Disciplinary Management System</h3>
<p>A full web application that helps a college record and manage student disciplinary cases, with every user seeing only what their role allows.</p>
<ul class="do">
<li>Role-based access for four roles: Administrator, Prefect Officer, Guidance Counselor and Principal.</li>
<li>Ten functional modules, each with its own access controls in the interface.</li>
<li>Passwords stored with bcrypt hashing.</li>
<li>Built for a college setting, covering 1st to 4th year levels.</li>
</ul>
</div>
</article>

<article class="proj">
<ul class="tags" aria-label="Focus areas"><li>Network design</li><li>Topology</li><li>Documentation</li></ul>
<div>
<h3>BCP Multi-Department Network Design</h3>
<p>A network design proposal for three departments: IT, Criminology and Education. It covers how each department’s network area is laid out and connected.</p>
<ul class="do">
<li>Planned the departments and their network areas.</li>
<li>Drew physical and logical topologies for the proposal.</li>
<li>Presented the full design as a slide deck.</li>
</ul>
</div>
</article>
</section>

<section id="skills">
<h2>Skills</h2>
<div class="skills">
<div><h3>Web development</h3><ul><li>PHP and MySQL</li><li>HTML, CSS, JavaScript</li><li>Role-based access control</li><li>Local servers with XAMPP</li></ul></div>
<div><h3>Networking</h3><ul><li>Network planning for multiple departments</li><li>Physical and logical topology</li><li>Proposal writing</li></ul></div>
<div><h3>Working style</h3><ul><li>Presenting technical work in slides</li><li>Documenting what I build</li><li>Learning new tools quickly</li></ul></div>
</div>
</section>

<section id="contact" class="contact">
<h2>Let’s work together</h2>
<p>I’m open to entry-level roles and internships. Send a message and I’ll reply soon.</p>
<div class="btns">
<a class="btn" href="mailto:your.email@example.com">Email Zyler</a>
<a class="btn alt" href="#">GitHub [add link]</a>
<a class="btn alt" href="#">LinkedIn [add link]</a>
</div>
</section>

<footer>© 2026 Zyler Delavictoria</footer>
</div>
</body>
</html>
